<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Live CMS</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">fwXSUPSoqvP0PMeMWECv</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">high-frequency-wand-guide-benefits-uses-complete-skincare-routine</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">High Frequency Wand Guide: Benefits, Uses &amp; Complete Skincare Routine</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1782123818923.6562</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">content-full</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">High Frequency Wand for Facial Care
Facial treatments are the most common use of High Frequency Wands.
Popular treatment areas include:
? Forehead
? Cheeks
? Chin
? Jawline
? Neck
The mushroom electrode is often preferred for larger treatment areas.
High Frequency Wand for Scalp Care
