Healthy hair care routines

How to Use a High Frequency Wand
Step 1: Cleanse Your Skin
Start with a clean face.
Remove:
Makeup

Oil

Dirt

Clean skin allows for a more effective skincare routine.
Step 2: Dry the Skin
Ensure skin is clean and dry before beginning treatment.
Step 3: Insert the Electrode
Choose the appropriate attachment.
Examples:
Mushroom Electrode

Spot Electrode

Comb Electrode

Secure it properly into the device.
Step 4: Turn on the Device
Begin at the lowest intensity setting.
Gradually increase if needed according to device instructions.
Step 5: Glide Gently Across the Skin
Move the electrode slowly across treatment areas.
Avoid pressing too hard.
Keep movements smooth and controlled.
Step 6: Complete Your Skincare Routine
After treatment, apply:
Hyaluronic Acid Serum
For hydration support.
Collagen Serum
For skin maintenance.
Moisturizer
To help maintain hydration.
