How Does a Facial Mask Maker Work?
Most facial mask makers follow a simple process:
Step 1
Add water.
Step 2
Insert a collagen tablet.
Step 3
Add selected ingredients.
Examples:
Cucumber extract

Aloe vera

Green tea

Rose water

Step 4
Start the machine.
Step 5
The device processes the ingredients and creates a mask.
Step 6
Allow the mask to cool before applying.
This simple process makes homemade facial masks easier than traditional DIY methods.
