Your skin barrier acts as the first line of defense against:
Pollution

Dust

Environmental stress

Moisture loss

A healthy skin barrier helps maintain:
? Hydration
? Comfort
? Smooth appearance
? Healthy-looking skin
When the barrier becomes compromised, skin may feel:
Tight

Dry

Irritated

Less comfortable

Supporting the barrier is therefore one of the most important goals of skincare.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
