For Refreshing Skin
Cucumber extract

Green tea

For Glow-Focused Routines
Fruit-based ingredients

Collagen tablets

This flexibility makes facial mask makers highly appealing.
3. Supports Hydration Routines
Hydration remains one of the most important aspects of skincare.
Hydrated skin often appears:
? Softer
? Smoother
? More radiant
? Healthier
Facial masks can complement existing hydration-focused routines.
4. Complements Modern Skincare Products
A facial mask maker works well alongside:
Hyaluronic Acid Serum

Collagen Serum

Moisturizers

Toners

Combining beauty devices and skincare products helps create a comprehensive routine.
5. Encourages Consistent Self-Care
