Step 1: Cleanse
Start with a clean face using a gentle cleanser.
Step 2: Apply Toner (Optional)
A hydrating toner can prepare the skin for serum application.
Step 3: Apply Hyaluronic Acid Serum
Apply a few drops evenly across the face and neck.
Gently pat into the skin.
Step 4: Moisturize
Follow with a moisturizer to help lock in hydration.
Step 5: Sunscreen (Morning Routine)
Always apply sunscreen during the day.
Sun protection is essential for maintaining healthy skin.
