Frequently Asked Questions
When should I start using anti-aging products?
Many people begin preventive skincare in their 20s, focusing on hydration and sun protection.
Does hydration help reduce wrinkles?
Hydrated skin often appears smoother and more plump.
Is collagen serum good for aging skin?
Collagen-based skincare products are commonly used to improve the appearance of firmness and texture.
How important is sunscreen for anti-aging?
Daily sun protection is considered one of the most effective anti-aging habits.
