Hair fall, thinning hair, premature graying, dandruff, and slow hair growth are among the most common hair concerns faced by both men and women. Factors such as pollution, stress, poor nutrition, hormonal changes, and excessive heat styling can weaken hair roots and affect overall hair health.
The Ilika Black Seed Hair Oil is specially formulated to nourish the scalp, strengthen hair follicles, reduce hair fall, and support healthy hair growth. Enriched with the goodness of Black Seed Oil (Kalonji Oil) and carefully selected botanical ingredients, this hair oil helps promote stronger, shinier, and healthier-looking hair naturally.
